{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19994","headline":"寒溪 七 · 孟郊","name":"寒溪 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪老哭甚寒，涕泗冰珊珊。\n飞死走死形，雪裂纷心肝。\n劒刃冻不割，弓弦强难弹。\n常闻君子武，不食天杀残。\n斸玉掩骼胔，吊琼哀阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}